is-nowhere-near-the-ipo-valuation-it-wants/</guid></item><item><title>拟议的清洁能源规则可能会动摇美国企业界以及您的投资组合</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/clean-energy-rule-accounting-guidelines/</link><description>拟议的排放核算改革可能会扰乱企业的净零排放计划和可再生能源市场。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-521926820-e1786652818914.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/clean-energy-rule-accounting-guidelines/</guid></item><item><title>兰德尔·莱恩 (Randall Lane) 在《福布斯》工作期间收受 600 万美元或许并没有违法，但他仍可能根据 140 年前的原则付出代价</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/randall-lane-law-6-million-forbes/</link><description>要求员工忠诚的纽约法律原则可能会给被解雇的《福布斯》编辑带来比任何犯罪曝光更大的风险。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2272333936-e1786670769363.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:51:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/randall-lane-law-6-million-forbes/</guid></item><item><title>Code Metal 获得五角大楼价值 8000 万美元的交易，以实现军事兵棋推演现代化</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/code-metal-lands-80-million-defense-tech-deal-with-pentagon-modernize-military-wargaming/</link><description>随着五角大楼越来越多地转向初创公司进行现代化建设，Code Metal 是一家价值 12.5 亿美元的软件公司，刚刚获得了 8000 万美元的交易。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Code-Metal-Peter-Morales-e1786646790523.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:30:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/code-metal-lands-80-million-defense-tech-deal-with-pentagon-modernize-military-wargaming/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 8 月 14 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-14-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Price-of-Oil-August-14.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:30:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-14-2026/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 因高管离职而更换首席营收官</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/openai-swaps-chief-revenue-officer-amid-executive-departures/</link><description>今天的版本：OpenAI 的领导力抢椅子游戏；微软的“超级应用程序”、德克萨斯州的蒂姆·库克、Databricks、Flock 相机、IBM 以及中国的人工智能影响力。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2278967313-e1786657208430.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:20:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/openai-swaps-chief-revenue-officer-amid-executive-departures/</guid></item><item><title>格伦·福格尔经营着世界上最大的在线旅游业务。他仍然亲自阅读客户投诉，因为“你必须把事情搞对”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/glenn-fogel-worlds-largest-online-travel-business-booking-holdings/</link><description>与其他行业一样，旅游业正在尝试人工智能的最佳用例。福格尔正在努力实现一个旅游业本身成为一个智能系统的世界&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2211276070-e1786701841971.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:07:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/glenn-fogel-worlds-largest-online-travel-business-booking-holdings/</guid></item><item><title>慈善事业最保守的秘密：你拥有的越多，你需要付出的就越少</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/philanthropys-best-kept-secret-the-more-you-have-the-less-youre-required-to-give/</link><description>美国 50 家最大的私人基金会共持有超过 5,350 亿美元资金，每年有义务分配 5%，这一比例自 1969 年以来最低保持不变。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/vandana-e1786641623882.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/philanthropys-best-kept-secret-the-more-you-have-the-less-youre-required-to-give/</guid></item></channel></rss>